New Clause 34 - Provision of free school lunches to all primary school children
_(1) Section 512ZB of the Education Act 1996 (provision of free school lunches and milk) is amended as follows.
(2) In paragraph (4A)(b), after __ear 2,_ insert __ear 3, year 4, year 5, year 6_.
(3) In subsection (4C), after __ge of 7;_ insert_
___ear 3_ means a year group in which the majority of children will, in the school year, attain the age of 8;
__ear 4_ means a year group in which the majority of children will, in the school year, attain the age of 9;
__ear 5_ means a year group in which the majority of children will, in the school year, attain the age of 10;
__ear 6_ means a year group in which the majority of children will, in the school year, attain the age of 11;__._(Adrian Ramsay.)

