(a) sustainable aviation fuel producers;
(b) representatives of the oil and gas industry and workforce;
(c) environmental organisations;
(d) local authorities; and
(e) academic experts.
(4) The report must be accompanied by a statement from the Secretary of State on how the findings of the report will be addressed through Government action.__(Olly Glover.)

I beg to move, That the clause be read a Second time.

